Package: quired
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: OpenBook project <quired@openbook.invalid>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Mhsbrian/OpenBook
Description: Quire harness host for OpenBook
 Finds the AI coding agents installed in this Linux environment and serves
 them to Quire, OpenBook's agent layer, over the Agent Client Protocol on
 vsock port 7690. Only the Android host may connect.
